RepriseOS extensions

Balance, Crossfeed, DSP and the Night Shift scheduling and gamma code are from
RevolaOS extensions, revision 36d197b180e55a304ea0468de4330c0d07fe715f.
Night Shift derives from kayboll’s RepriseOS work. Playback Log derives from
the work of brilliant-alien and lgreitis in osos-lab. Its Settings artwork is
from osos-lab commit 10485fa. Album Artists, File Info and Playback Queue are
from RevolaOS extensions, revision 900d5c4ea61e31834d85f9b62c353ce48e58419a,
and derive from the RepriseOS core: Album Artists by lgreitis, File Info by
lgreitis and paviro, Play Next and Play Last by lgreitis and brilliant-alien,
and Up Next by Alex Ball. Their Settings icons are Cupertino Icons glyphs
(MIT), see the LICENSE.cupertino-icons beside each. Equalizer, Clicker Modes,
iAP Auth Bypass and EU Volume Limit are from RevolaOS extensions, revision
509cd1630325a53495798541c170e72854bbb17e. Equalizer, Clicker Modes and iAP
Auth Bypass derive from the RepriseOS core: Custom EQ by lgreitis and paviro,
clicker modes by Alex Ball and lgreitis, iAP auth bypass by RaduTek; EU Volume
Limit is by paviro. Equalizer's Settings icon is the core's own settings-eq
art; the other three are Cupertino Icons glyphs (MIT), see the
LICENSE.cupertino-icons beside each. Homebrew is from RevolaOS extensions,
revision 509cd1630325a53495798541c170e72854bbb17e, and derives from the
RepriseOS core's homebrew patch by lgreitis; its catalog icon is a Cupertino
Icons glyph (MIT). Appearance is from RevolaOS extensions, revision
a32d616f5a06, and derives from the RepriseOS core's Dark Mode by lgreitis and
Alex Ball; its Settings icons are Cupertino Icons glyphs (MIT), see the
LICENSE.cupertino-icons beside them, and the Classic theme it carries is built
by the rvt compiler in themes/ (see themes/NOTICE). Night Shift's hosted row and
choice screen are from RevolaOS extensions, revision d04fa7d. The original
RevolaOS notice follows.

